    synonyms (lowering sullen threatening)
  entry
    definition "(of an actor or role) being or playing the villain"
    examples ("Iago is the heavy role in ‘Othello’")
    id oewn-02524297-s
    partOfSpeech s
  entry
    definition "permitting little if any light to pass through because of denseness of matter"
    examples ("dense smoke" "heavy fog" "impenetrable gloom")
    id oewn-02425186-s
    partOfSpeech s
    synonyms (dense impenetrable)
  entry
    definition "of relatively large extent and density"
    examples ("a heavy line")
    id oewn-02420355-s
    partOfSpeech s
  entry
    definition "made of fabric having considerable thickness"
    examples ("a heavy coat")
    id oewn-02420243-s
    partOfSpeech s
  entry
    definition prodigious
    examples ("big spender" "big eater" "heavy investor")
    id oewn-02411163-s
